nt type handling.\n* **Proxy Configuration**: Configurable proxy support for enterprise environments.\n* **Timeout and Abort Support**: Configurable request timeouts with integrated abort signal handling for graceful cancellation.\n\nThis library is used by JavaScript SDKs generated by the [APIMatic Code Generator](http://www.apimatic.io). For details on supported platforms and build artifacts, see the [Build and Usage Section](https://github.com/apimatic/apimatic-js-runtime?tab=readme-ov-file#builds-and-usage).","readmeFilename":"README.md"}